S. Kunieda (LANL/JAEA) updated the alpha-particle production      2431 1451
cross sections and energy spectra in MF6MT5 , based on the        2431 1451
improved Iwamoto-Harada model.                                    2431 1451
                                                     [Sep 3,2011] 2431 1451
