            UNCERTAINTY FILES                                     2431 1451
        AN LB=8 SECTION IS INCLUDED FOR ALL NON-DERIVED FILES AS  2431 1451
        REQUIRED BY ENDF/B-VI.                                    2431 1451
                                                                  2431 1451
 33-1   UNCERTAINTIES ARE DERIVED FROM 1.E-5 TO 100 EV.  FROM 100 2431 1451
        EV TO 20 MEV THEY ARE EXPLICIT, USING LB=0,1 AND 8.       2431 1451
 33-2   FROM 1.E-5 TO 100 EV, UNCERTAINTIES ARE EXPLICIT, BASED   2431 1451
        UPON THERMAL UNCERTAINTY AND OTHER DATA.  FROM 100 EV TO  2431 1451
        20 MEV THE FILES ARE DERIVED.                             2431 1451
 33-3   FROM 1.E-5 TO 980 KEV UNCERTAINTIES ARE DERIVED.  FROM 9802431 1451
        KEV TO 20 MEV UNCERTAINTIES ARE EXPLICIT, USING LB=1 AND 82431 1451
 33-4   UNCERTAINTIES ARE ALL DERIVED.                            2431 1451
 33-16  UNCERTAINTIES FOR (N,2N) ARE EXPLICIT, CSISRS DATA USED   2431 1451
        AS A GUIDE.                                               2431 1451
 33-22  UNCERTAINTIES FOR (N,NA) ARE EXPLICIT, ESTIMATED FROM TNG 2431 1451
 33-28  UNCERTAINTIES FOR (N,NP) ARE EXPLICIT, ESTIMATED FROM TNG 2431 1451
 33-51-91  UNCERTAINTIES FOR INELASTIC SCATTERING ARE EXPLICIT,   2431 1451
           BASED ON DATA AND CALCULATION UNCERTAINTIES.           2431 1451
 33-102 UNCERTAINTIES ARE EXPLICIT, BASED ON THERMAL DATA AT LOW  2431 1451
        ENERGIES, AND CALCULATED RESULTS ABOVE 980 KEV.           2431 1451
 33-103 UNCERTAINTIES ESTIMATED FROM TNG.                         2431 1451
 33-107 UNCERTAINTIES ESTIMATED FROM TNG.                         2431 1451
